{"suttaId":"thag10.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2346,2376],"vripara":"557"},"segments":{"thag10.4:0.4":"Cūḷapanthakattheragāthā","thag10.4:1.1":"“Dandhā mayhaṃ gatī āsi, paribhūto pure ahaṃ;","thag10.4:1.3":"Bhātā ca maṃ paṇāmesi,‘gaccha dāni tuvaṃ gharaṃ’.","thag10.4:2.1":"“Sohaṃ paṇāmito santo [bhātā (aṭṭha.)], saṅghārāmassa koṭṭhake;","thag10.4:2.3":"Dummano tattha aṭṭhāsiṃ, sāsanasmiṃ apekkhavā.","thag10.4:3.1":"“Bhagavā tattha āgacchi [āgañchi (sī. pī.)], sīsaṃ mayhaṃ parāmasi;","thag10.4:3.3":"Bāhāya maṃ gahetvāna, saṅghārāmaṃ pavesayi.","thag10.4:4.1":"“Anukampāya me satthā, pādāsi pādapuñchaniṃ;","thag10.4:4.3":"‘Etaṃ suddhaṃ adhiṭṭhehi, ekamantaṃ svadhiṭṭhitaṃ’.","thag10.4:5.1":"“Tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, vihāsiṃ sāsane rato;","thag10.4:5.3":"Samādhiṃ paṭipādesiṃ, uttamatthassa pattiyā.","thag10.4:6.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thag10.4:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thag10.4:7.1":"“Sahassakkhattumattānaṃ, nimminitvāna panthako;","thag10.4:7.3":"Nisīdambavane ramme, yāva kālappavedanā.","thag10.4:8.1":"“Tato me satthā pāhesi, dūtaṃ kālappavedakaṃ;","thag10.4:8.3":"Paveditamhi kālamhi, vehāsādupasaṅkamiṃ [vehāsānupasaṅkamiṃ (syā. ka.)].","thag10.4:9.1":"“Vanditvā satthuno pāde, ekamantaṃ nisīdahaṃ;","thag10.4:9.3":"Nisinnaṃ maṃ viditvāna, atha satthā paṭiggahi.","thag10.4:10.1":"“Āyāgo sabbalokassa, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","thag10.4:10.3":"Puññakkhettaṃ manussānaṃ, paṭigaṇhittha dakkhiṇan”ti.","thag10.4:10.5":"… Cūḷapanthako thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":2388,"to":2388,"paras":[{"para":2388,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag10.4:10"],"lines":["<b>Sahassakkhattun</b>ti sahassaṃ.","“Sahassavāran”ti keci vadanti.","Ekāvajjanena pana thero sahasse manomaye kāye nimmini, na vārena.","Te ca kho aññamaññamasadise vividhañca kammaṃ karonte.","“Kiṃ pana sāvakānampi evarūpaṃ iddhinimmānaṃ sambhavatī”ti?","Na sambhavati sabbesaṃ, abhinīhārasampattiyā pana ayameva thero evamakāsi, tathā hesa iminā aṅgena etadagge ṭhapito.","<b>Panthako nisīdī</b>ti attānameva paraṃ viya vadati.","<b>Ambavane</b>ti, ambavane jīvakena katavihāre.","<b>Vehāsādupasaṅkamin</b>ti <b>vehāsā</b>ti karaṇe nissakkavacanaṃ, vehāsenāti attho, <b>da</b> -kāro padasandhikaro.","<b>Athā</b>ti, mama nisajjāya pacchā.","<b>Paṭiggahī</b>ti dakkhiṇodakaṃ paṭiggaṇhi.","<b>Āyāgo sabbalokassā</b>ti, sabbassa sadevakassa lokassa aggadakkhiṇeyyatāya deyyadhammaṃ ānetvā yajitabbaṭṭhānabhūto.","<b>Āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho</b>ti, mahāphalabhāvakaraṇena dakkhiṇāhutīnaṃ paṭiggaṇhako.","<b>Paṭiggaṇhittha dakkhiṇan</b>ti jīvakena upanītaṃ yāgukhajjādibhedaṃ dakkhiṇaṃ paṭiggahesi."],"lineRefs":[["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"],["thag10.4:10"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag10.4:10.3","da",0,8],["thag10.4:10.1","paṭiggahī",0,10],["thag10.4:10.1","āyāgo sabbalokassā",0,11],["thag10.4:10.1","āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho",0,12]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
